<title>UK: De la Rue gains after Kleinwort repeats buy.</title>
<headline>De la Rue gains after Kleinwort repeats buy.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in banknote printer De la Rue Plc gained after Dresdner Kleinwort Benson reiterated a &quot;buy&quot; recommendation on the stock, dealers said.</p>
<p>De la Rue shares were up 20 pence to 549 pence by 1010 GMT while the FTSE-100 index was down 19.9 points to 4,250.8.</p>
<p>An analyst at Kleinwort confirmed that a &quot;buy&quot; rating had been repeated, saying the stock was undervalued, but declined to make any further comment.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
